&gt;<br>
&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 This document specifies version 1.3 of the Transport Laye=
r Security<br>
&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 (TLS) protocol.=C2=A0 TLS allows client/server applicatio=
ns to communicate<br>
&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 over the Internet in a way that is designed to prevent ea=
vesdropping,<br>
&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 tampering, and message forgery.<br>
